      "status": "ready",
      "prompt": "创建一个 CanvasManager 类，负责创建和管理 HTML5 Canvas。\n\n要求：\n1. 在指定的容器元素中创建 <canvas>，设置固定宽度 800px，高度 600px。\n2. 提供 getCanvas() 返回 canvas DOM 元素。\n3. 提供 getContext() 返回 2d 渲染上下文。\n4. 提供 getWidth() 和 getHeight() 返回画布宽高。\n5. 提供 clear() 方法清除画布。\n\n输出文件：src/core/canvas.js",
      "upstreamContractDetail": {
        "title": "无上游依赖",
        "list": []
      },
      "downstreamContractDetail": {
        "title": "为下游任务提供以下接口",
        "list": [
          {
            "label": "获取 canvas DOM 元素",
            "contract_api": "getCanvas() -> HTMLCanvasElement",
            "from": "task-canvas"
          },
          {
            "label": "获取 2d 渲染上下文",
            "contract_api": "getContext() -> CanvasRenderingContext2D",
            "from": "task-canvas"
          },
          {
            "label": "获取画布宽度",
            "contract_api": "getWidth() -> number",
            "from": "task-canvas"
          },
          {
            "label": "获取画布高度",
            "contract_api": "getHeight() -> number",
            "from": "task-canvas"
          },
          {
