    {
      "id": "task-game-loop",
      "name": "游戏循环",
      "description": "实现基于 requestAnimationFrame 的游戏循环，支持注册更新和渲染回调。",
      "moduleId": "mod-core",
      "status": "ready",
      "prompt": "创建一个 GameLoop 类，管理游戏循环。\n\n要求：\n1. 使用 requestAnimationFrame 驱动循环。\n2. 提供 registerUpdate(callback) 注册更新函数，callback 接收 deltaTime 参数。\n3. 提供 registerRender(callback) 注册渲染函数。\n4. 提供 start() 和 stop() 方法控制循环。\n5. 在每一帧中，先调用所有更新回调，再调用所有渲染回调。\n\n输出文件：src/core/gameLoop.js",
      "upstreamContractDetail": {
        "title": "无上游依赖（画布由下游使用）",
        "list": []
      },
      "downstreamContractDetail": {
        "title": "为下游任务提供以下接口",
        "list": [
          {
            "label": "注册更新回调",
            "contract_api": "registerUpdate(callback: (deltaTime: number) => void)",
            "from": "task-game-loop"
          },
          {
            "label": "注册渲染回调",
            "contract_api": "registerRender(callback: () => void)",
            "from": "task-game-loop"
          },
          {
            "label": "开始游戏循环",
            "contract_api": "start()",
            "from": "task-game-loop"
          },
          {
            "label": "停止游戏循环",
            "contract_api": "stop()",
            "from": "task-game-loop"
          }
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "target": "验证注册的更新回调被调用",
          "api": "testUpdateCallback()"
        },
        {
          "target": "验证注册的渲染回调被调用",
          "api": "testRenderCallback()"
        }
      ],
      "test_result": [],
